\par
\href{https://spica.unil.ch}{SPICA}, a portal for immune cell analysis (Andreatta et al., 2022)
\par
Atlases in SPICA include 
\par
\begin{itemize}

\item tumor-infiltrating T-cells, 
\item virus-specific CD8 T cells,
\item virus-specific CD4 T cells,
\item tumor-associated mononuclear myeloid cells

\end{itemize}

\par
All data are provided as Seurat-compatible objects},
