“Kim et al. Genome Biology (2020) 21:196 Page 4 of 19 natural Poisson sampling noise in UMI data for a homogeneous cell population, and they do not introduce excessive zero inflation” (Kim et al., 2020, p. 4)
\par
“immune-related genes have significantly higher proportion of zero-inflated genes compared to genes that are not related to immune function.” (Kim et al., 2020, p. 5)
